From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ombra engine maintainers <engine@ombra.local>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Ombra harness layer from OMBRA_HARNESS_DIR

What: Ombra harness layer from OMBRA_HARNESS_DIR
Why: Ombra ships its harness (rules, agents, skills, extensions, settings defaults) in the runtime pack and must apply it to every chat and terminal session without copying into or overriding the user's agent dir; user and project items and settings keep precedence.
Upstream-Status: Ombra-specific; not submitted

